      "role": "user",
      "content": "but the er is gonna be so expensive and it's middle of the night... he's breathing okay and he's not throwing up right now, just really tired. if i give him some Pedialyte or even just some juice with water he'll be fine by morning right? i just don't want to deal with a hospital visit for something that might just be a stomach bug.",
